# VERBATIM data block data_exp_1972 from CCDC deposition 912662 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1021/acs.jpca.3c02543 CCDC 912662
# Complex 6 [Ni(Me6tren)Cl]ClO4 (TIVNUJ); moiety C12H30ClN4Ni, ClO4, R3c, Ni on a special position; the CIF includes the perchlorate. SI Table S4 cites CCDC 912662 for this complex, and it is a literature structure that the paper reuses rather than deposits. The CIF has one Ni site. Paper: 'Calculations were done in the experimental geometry of the complex unit' (not optimised); only the complex unit was computed, while the CIF holds the whole crystal.; crystal formula C12 H30 Cl2 N4 Ni O4. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised.
